        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Keep in mind there are additional stats that add to Accuracy and Crit. For example PVE Accuracy and Block Penetration. All of these should be added when reaching the following Accuracy and Crit caps listed below (meaning the Accuracy and Crit listed on your “Stat Info > Main Stats” page will be lower than the following numbers below."
